aterial`. Randomize the scale, opacity, and position of thousands of vertices in a massive spherical radius around the Earth.\n\n### 6. Animation Loop & Camera Controls\n\n* Build a smooth `requestAnimationFrame` render loop.\n* Apply a slow, continuous baseline rotation to both the Earth and cloud meshes.\n* Configure `OrbitControls` with `enableDamping = true` for a heavy, cinematic feel when the user drags the mouse.\n* Restrict `minDistance` and `maxDistance` on the camera to prevent zooming inside the globe or zooming too far out. Disable panning (`enablePan = false`) to keep the Earth centered at all times.\n\nEnsure the final output is well-commented, strictly modular, and structured so that it can be pasted into a single `index.html` file and run instantly in a modern browser.", "tool_call_id": null, "tool_calls": null, "tool_name": null, "effect_disposition": null, "timestamp": 1790837327.7292583, "token_count": null, "finish_reason": null, "reasoning": null, "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_details": null, "codex_reasoning_items": null, "codex_message_items": null, "platform_message_id": null, "observed": 0, "active": 1, "compacted": 0, "api_content": null, "display_kind": null, "display_metadata": null, "message_uid": "ca8212b5665a48468b87a2a73e9c93aa", "absorbed_message_uids": null, "tool_call_uids": null, "tool_call_uid": null}, {"id": 1005, "session_id": "20261001_092622_bd7d34", "role": "assistant", "content": "Nice, a Three.js Earth — let me build it properly and deploy it. First, recon: check CDN versions, the texture URLs I plan to use, and whether the tunnel is still alive:", "tool_call_id": null, "tool_calls": [{"id": "call_00_ojGbWWj90Kd8ALItBxaJ4010", "call_id": "call_00_ojGbWWj90Kd8ALItBxaJ4010", "response_item_id": "fc_00_ojGbWWj90Kd8ALItBxaJ4010", "type": "function", "function": {"name": "terminal", "arguments": "{\"command\": \"echo \\\"=== latest three version ===\\\"; curl -s --max-time 10 \\\"https://data.jsdelivr.com/v1/packages/np