3d", "role": "tool", "content": "{\"output\": \"=== backend/\\ndescription: 'Backend specialist. Builds and maintains server-side code: APIs, data\\n  models, business logic, auth, background jobs, database integrations, and query\\n  correctness. Defines and publishes the API contract.'\\ndescription_auto: false\\n=== frontend/\\ndescription: 'Frontend specialist. Builds and fixes UI: components, styling, client-side\\n  state, routing, accessibility, and browser behaviour. Owns rendering and interaction.'\\ndescription_auto: false\\n=== manager/\\ndescription: Manager / orchestrator. Decomposes incoming work and dispatches it to\\n  specialist agents (researcher, backend, frontend, devops, reviewer) via 'hermes\\n  -p <agent> chat -q', then verifies and integrates their results. Answers trivial\\n  asks directly without fan-out.\\ndescription_auto: false\\n=== researcher/\\ndescription: Research specialist. Finds, extracts, and verifies information from the\\n  web, docs, and codebases. Returns findings with sources and explicit confidence.\\ndescription_auto: false\\n=== reviewer/\\ndescription: Code review specialist. Audits code and diffs for correctness, security,\\n  regressions, and maintainability. Returns findings ranked by severity with file\\n  and line references.\\ndescription_auto: false\\n=== .deleted ===\\ntotal 24\\ndrwxr-xr-x. 1 sudhanshunaik sudhanshunaik 64 Sep 30 20:38 .\\ndrwxr-xr-x. 1 sudhanshunaik sudhanshunaik 96 Sep 30 20:38 ..\\n-rw-r--r--. 1 sudhanshunaik sudhanshunaik  8 Sep 24 21:02 chief\\n-rw-r--r--. 1 sudhanshunaik sudhanshunaik  8 Sep 30 20:30 devops\\n-rw-r--r--. 1 sudhanshunaik sudhanshunaik  8 Sep 24 19:45 forge\\n-rw-r--r--. 1 sudhanshunaik sudhanshunaik  8 Sep 24 19:45 ledger\\n-rw-r--r--. 1 sudhanshunaik sudhanshunaik  8 Sep 24 19:45 quill\\n-rw-r--r--. 1 sudhanshunaik sudhanshunaik  8 Sep 24 19:45 scout\\n=== aliases ===\\ndrwxr-xr-x. 1 sudhanshunaik sudhanshunaik 196 Sep 30 20:38 .\\ndrwx------. 1 sudhanshunaik sudhanshunai